{
  "version": 1,
  "kind": "function-plot",
  "title": "2x2 线性变换的主轴伸缩",
  "description": "改变特征值大小，观察单位圆在矩阵作用下映成的椭圆其半轴（特征值）如何伸缩。",
  "xDomain": [-3, 3],
  "yDomain": [-3, 3],
  "xLabel": "x",
  "yLabel": "y",
  "samples": 240,
  "parameters": [
    {"id": "lambda1", "label": "特征值 λ₁", "min": 0.3, "max": 2.5, "value": 1.8, "step": 0.1},
    {"id": "lambda2", "label": "特征值 λ₂", "min": 0.3, "max": 2.0, "value": 0.8, "step": 0.1}
  ],
  "series": [
    {"label": "单位圆 x²+y²=1", "expression": "sqrt(1 - x^2)", "color": "#166534"},
    {"label": "上半椭圆 (变换后)", "expression": "lambda2 * sqrt(1 - (x/lambda1)^2)", "color": "#c8102e"},
    {"label": "下半椭圆 (变换后)", "expression": "-lambda2 * sqrt(1 - (x/lambda1)^2)", "color": "#c8102e"}
  ],
  "caption": "特征值 λ₁、λ₂ 决定沿两个特征方向上的伸缩倍数——这正是对角化 \\(A = S\\Lambda S^{-1}\\) 的几何含义。",
  "source": {"label": "Lecture 21 & 22 slides (Strang 18.06)", "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-06-linear-algebra-spring-2010/"}
}
